  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Guinea Community Palm Oil Processing Expansion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Palm Oil Processing, Beneficiaries: Women, Description: CAD seeks to work with palm oil processing and marketing groups in Forest Guinea to provide improved access to water; appropriate production equipment, materials and tools; and access to working capital, training and technical assistance. CAD will facilitate procurement of equipment, supplies, and technical assistance., ,</narrative>
  </description>
